[0.032724, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[1d\u001b[1K\u001b[C▏ $ md5sum report.json      -> 0803e83d3891c5d3a5e748067a084ecb   (unchanged)\u001b[39X\u001b[39C│\u001b[1X\u001b[C+\u001b[2;120H\u001b[1K\u001b[C│\u001b[K\r\n  The good report survived: the negative-quantity run fails during `load_rows`, before\u001b[34X\u001b[34C│\u001b[K\r\n  `write_report`, so the same report.json bytes are intact. Tests: `python3 -m unittest\u001b[33X\u001b[33C│\u001b[K\r\n  -v` → Ran 15 tests, OK (10 original + 5 new: negative rejection, bad-input preserves\u001b[34X\u001b[34C│\u001b[K\r\n  last good report, quarantined non-sellable, unknown status non-sellable, low-stock\u001b[36X\u001b[36C│\u001b[K\r\n  excludes non-sellable).\u001b[95X\u001b[95C│\u001b[K\u001b[8;120H\u001b[1K\u001b[C│\u001b[K\r\n  For your colleague — the normal command and expected totals:\u001b[58X\u001b[58C│\u001b[K\u001b[10;120H\u001b[1K\u001b[C│\u001b[K\u001b[11;4H\u001b[1K\u001b[C▏ python3 inventory.py\u001b[17X\u001b[17C# defaults: inventory.csv -> report.json\u001b[37X\u001b[37C│\u001b[K\u001b[12;4H\u001b[1K\u001b[C▏ python3 inventory.py --low-stock 10  # adds the reorder list\u001b[54X\u001b[54C│\u001b[K\u001b[13;120H\u001b[1K\u001b[C│\u001b[K\r\n  On the real inventory.csv, the report must read Available units: 19, Returned units: 4,\u001b[31X\u001b[31C│\u001b[K\r\n  Line items: 4, and under `--low-stock 10` a reorder list of just Nuts 7. Before the fix\u001b[31X\u001b[31C│\u001b[K\r\n  it read 24 because the 5 quarantined Clips were counted as sellable; now any status\u001b[35X\u001b[35C│\u001b[K\r\n  other than `available` (quarantined, damaged, a typo) is excluded by default, and a\u001b[35X\u001b[35C│\u001b[K\r\n  negative quantity is a loud error instead of a plausible report.\u001b[54X\u001b[54C│\u001b[K\u001b[19;120H\u001b[1K\u001b[C│\u001b[K\r\n  Changed here: inventory.py (allow-list `SELLABLE_STATUSES`, returned_units counted by\u001b[33X\u001b[33C│\u001b[K\r\n  membership, negative-quantity guard), test_inventory.py (+5 regressions), README.md\u001b[35X\u001b[35C│\u001b[K\r\n  (input rules). report.json is untracked build output. Nothing is committed — say the\u001b[34X\u001b[34C│\u001b[K\r\n  word and I'll commit.\u001b[97X\u001b[97C│\u001b[K\u001b[24;120H\u001b[1K\u001b[C│\u001b[K\u001b[25;4H\u001b[1K\u001b[C· resumed · parts store quarantine and negative quantity bugs\u001b[55X\u001b[55C│\u001b[K\u001b[26;4H\u001b[1K\u001b[C· esc interrupts · ctrl+c quits · ? for help\u001b[72X\u001b[72C│\u001b[K\u001b[27;120H\u001b[1K\u001b[C│\u001b[K\r\n  ✓ 3 tasks done · 2m07s\u001b[96X\u001b[96C│\u001b[K\u001b[29;4H\u001b[1K\u001b[C◆ reading: Our parts-store report says 24 available units, but five … · 23s\u001b[41X\u001b[41C│\u001b[K\u001b[30;4H\u001b[1K\u001b[C◆ reading: Our parts-store report says 24 available units, but five … · 7s\u001b[42X\u001b[42C│\u001b[K\u001b[31;4H\u001b[1K\u001b[C◆ Please implement those inventory fixes: only available status · 40s · 4 files\u001b[37X\u001b[37C│\u001b[K\u001b[32;6H\u001b[1K\u001b[C\"Implemented both inventory fixes in the copy (edits come home automatically; wo…\" · started 12:30 · ctrl+o output│\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n─ deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash:auto · ◇ YOLO ──────────────────────────────────────────────────    $0.07 · ⟲ saved $0.0117 \u001b[35;1H ›\u001b[K\u001b[30m\u001b[42m\r\n[chat] 0:codeaf*                                                                    \"parts store quarantin\" 12:41 27-Sep-26\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[?12l\u001b[?25h\u001b[5 q\u001b[35;4H\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[?12l\u001b[?25h\u001b[6 q\u001b[?1006l\u001b[?1000l\u001b[?1002l\u001b[?1003l\u001b[1;1H\u001b[1;36r\u001b[35;4H\u001b[?12l\u001b[?25h\u001b[5 q\u001b[?1006l\u001b[?1000l\u001b[?1002l\u001b[?1003l\u001b[?1006h\u001b[?1000h\u001b[?1002h\u001b[?1003h\u001b[?25l\u001b[1d\u001b[1K\u001b[C▏ $ md5sum report.json      -> 0803e83d3891c5d3a5e748067a084ecb   (unchanged)\u001b[39X\u001b[39C│\u001b[1X\u001b[C+\u001b[2;120H\u001b[1K\u001b[C│\u001b[K\r\n 